#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment.rst:7
msgid ""
"The Mattermost desktop app is available for Windows, macOS, and Linux "
"operating systems, and offers :doc:`additional functionality </end-user-"
"guide/preferences/customize-desktop-app-experience>` beyond the web-based"
" experience."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱은 Windows, macOS, Linux 운영 체제에서 사용할 수 있으며, "
"웹 기반 환경을 넘어서는 :doc:`추가 기능 </end-user-guide/preferences/customize-"
"desktop-app-experience>`\\ 을 제공합니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment.rst:9
msgid ""
"Learn more about desktop app :ref:`software requirements <deployment-"
"guide/software-hardware-requirements:desktop apps>`, :doc:`releases and "
"server compatibility </product-overview/mattermost-desktop-releases>` as "
"well as the :doc:`what's changed across releases </product-overview"
"/desktop-app-changelog>`."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 앱 :ref:`소프트웨어 요구 사항 <deployment-guide/software-hardware-"
"requirements:desktop apps>`, :doc:`릴리스 및 서버 호환성 </product-overview"
"/mattermost-desktop-releases>`, :doc:`릴리스별 변경 사항 </product-overview"
"/desktop-app-changelog>`\\ 에 대해 자세히 알아보세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment.rst:12
msgid "Download"
msgstr "다운로드"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment.rst:14
msgid ""
"Download and install the Mattermost desktop app from the `App Store "
"(macOS) <https://www.apple.com/app-store/>`_, `Microsoft Store (Windows) "
"<https://apps.microsoft.com/home?hl=en-US&gl=US>`_, or by :doc:`using a "
"package manager (Linux) </deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-"
"install>`. We strongly recommend installing the desktop app on a local "
"drive. Network shares aren't supported."
msgstr ""
"`App Store(macOS) <https://www.apple.com/app-store/>`_, `Microsoft "
"Store(Windows) <https://apps.microsoft.com/home?hl=en-US&gl=US>`_\\ 에서 "
"OKR.BEST 데스크톱 앱을 다운로드하여 설치하거나 :doc:`패키지 관리자(Linux)를 "
"사용 </deployment-guide/desktop/linux-desktop-install>`\\ 하세요. 데스크톱 앱은 "
"로컬 드라이브에 설치할 것을 강력히 권장합니다. 네트워크 공유는 지원되지 "
"않습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment.rst:16
msgid ""
"In Matermost, users are notified under **Downloads** when new desktop app"
" releases become available. If managing the distribution of the Desktop "
"app on behalf of users, you can recommend that your users disable desktop"
" update notifications by going to **… > File > Settings** on Windows or "
"**Mattermost > Settings** on Mac and clearing the **Automatically check "
"for updates** option."
msgstr ""
"OKR.BEST에서는 새 데스크톱 앱 릴리스가 제공되면 **Downloads**\\ 에 사용자에게 "
"알림이 표시됩니다. 사용자를 대신해 데스크톱 앱 배포를 관리하는 경우, "
"사용자에게 Windows에서는 **… > File > Settings**, Mac에서는 **Mattermost > "
"Settings**\\ 로 이동해 **Automatically check for updates** 옵션을 해제하여 "
"데스크톱 업데이트 알림을 비활성화하도록 권장할 수 있습니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment.rst:18
msgid ""
"See additional deployment options below to manage distribution of the "
"desktop app to your users."
msgstr ""
"사용자에게 데스크톱 앱을 배포하는 것을 관리하려면 아래의 추가 배포 옵션을 "
"참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment.rst:21
msgid "Windows distribution channels"
msgstr "Windows 배포 채널"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment.rst:23
msgid ""
"From desktop v6.1, organizations deploying on Windows have 2 primary "
"distribution options:"
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 v6.1부터 Windows에 배포하는 조직에는 두 가지 주요 배포 옵션이 "
"있습니다:"

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment.rst:25
msgid ""
"**Windows Store** (recommended): Provides automatic updates through the "
"Microsoft Store infrastructure. This is the recommended option for most "
"organizations seeking streamlined update management."
msgstr ""
"**Windows Store**(권장): Microsoft Store 인프라를 통해 자동 업데이트를 "
"제공합니다. 간소화된 업데이트 관리를 원하는 대부분의 조직에 권장되는 "
"옵션입니다."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment.rst:26
msgid ""
"**MSI packages**: Traditional deployment method with full control over "
"installation timing. See the :doc:`MSI installer and group policy guide "
"</deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-msi-installer-and-group-policy-"
"install>` documentation for details."
msgstr ""
"**MSI 패키지**: 설치 시점을 완전히 제어할 수 있는 전통적인 배포 방식입니다. "
"자세한 내용은 :doc:`MSI 설치 관리자 및 그룹 정책 가이드 </deployment-guide"
"/desktop/desktop-msi-installer-and-group-policy-install>` 문서를 참고하세요."

#: ../../source/deployment-guide/desktop/desktop-app-deployment.rst:28
msgid ""
"The desktop v6.1 app includes in-app update notifications. All "
"distribution channels (Windows Store, MSI, Mac App Store, Flathub, "
"APT/RPM) release simultaneously to prevent notification and availability "
"mismatches across deployment methods."
msgstr ""
"데스크톱 v6.1 앱에는 앱 내 업데이트 알림이 포함됩니다. 모든 배포 채널(Windows "
"Store, MSI, Mac App Store, Flathub, APT/RPM)이 동시에 릴리스되어 배포 방식 간 "
"알림 및 가용성 불일치를 방지합니다."

